@startuml sd07-ask-assistant-cli
!include style.iuml
hide footbox
autonumber
title SD07: Ask the Assistant through the CLI JSON mode (UC13; feature F10; Stage 3 KUMA entry point)

actor "Automation Client\n(for example the KUMA harness)" as Client
participant ":AskCli" as Cli <<boundary>>
participant ":TraceWiseFacade" as Facade <<control>>
participant ":AssistantService" as Asst <<control>>
participant ":ConversationMemory" as Memory
participant ":AgentRunner" as Runner <<control>>
participant ":ClaimVerifier" as Verifier

Client -> Cli : tracewise ask "<question>" --json
activate Cli
Cli -> Cli : call()
note right of Cli : Template Method: CliCommandBase.call()\nruns execute(), then print(), and maps\nerrors to a non-zero exit code.
Cli -> Cli : execute()
Cli -> Facade : ask(question, context)
note right of Facade : From the GUI, the AML Analyst uses\nAssistantView.onSubmit(text), which calls\nthe same TraceWiseFacade.ask(); the rest\nof the interaction is identical.
activate Facade
Facade -> Asst : ask(question, context)
activate Asst
Asst -> Memory : recent(n)
activate Memory
return history
create participant "task:AssistantTask" as Task
Asst -> Task : <<create>> (question, history)
create participant "trace:AgentTrace" as Trace
Asst -> Trace : <<create>>
Asst -> Runner : run(task, trace)
activate Runner
ref over Runner, Trace : Agent loop as in SD04, from systemPrompt() to finish(outcome):\nLLM calls, validated tool calls, trace recording.\nThe system prompt tells the agent to treat text\nfound in data (for example transaction memos)\nas data, never as instructions.
return outcome
alt outcome is COMPLETED
  Asst -> Task : parseAnswer(outcome.finalText())
  activate Task
  create participant "answer:AssistantAnswer" as Answer
  Task -> Answer : <<create>>
  return answer
  Asst -> Verifier : verify(claims)
  activate Verifier
  note right of Verifier : UC06, as in SD04.
  return verificationReport
  Asst -> Memory : append(question, answer)
  Asst --> Facade : answer (with trace and verificationReport)
else outcome is FAILED
  Asst --> Facade : error after retries
end
deactivate Asst
Facade --> Cli : answer or error
deactivate Facade
Cli -> Cli : print(result)
note right of Cli : With --json: answer, every tool call\nwith arguments and result, the\nverification results and final status.
Cli --> Client : JSON on stdout; exit code 0 (or non-zero on error)
deactivate Cli
@enduml
